# Robot model and simulation worlds

## Coordinate convention

**FLU** (Forward-Left-Up) for CAD export and URDF/SDF.

## `dondron_description`

- URDF for ROS (RViz, robot_state_publisher)
- SDF for Gazebo Harmonic spawn
- Separate visual mesh (detail) and collision mesh (simplified)
- Inertia: kg·m² (convert from CAD g·mm²)

## Gazebo Harmonic

- Bridge via `ros-jazzy-ros-gz` — vendor packages under `/opt/ros/jazzy`
- Worlds in `simulation/worlds/`
- Sensors: IMU, GPS, RGB camera → `sensor_msgs/msg/Image` on `/camera/image_raw`

## Physics notes (from blueprint)

- Thrust: `MulticopterMotorModel` plugin
- Target AUW ~1.4–1.5 kg for Mark4 7" + Orange Pi 5 stack

Vault: blueprint §3 (Simulation & Digital Twin)
